  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: secure cookies sent in cleartext to HTTP proxy in CONNECT\n     requests\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-5119.patch: don't add cookies to a CONNECT\n       request for a tunnelled HTTPS connection in msg_starting_cb() in\n       libsoup/soup-cookie-jar.c\n     - CVE-2026-5119\n   * debian/patches/fix-tests-AuthDigestQop-none.patch: remove\n     \"AuthDigestQop none\" from the /Digest/realm3 location and use a\n     file-based accept mutex in tests/httpd.conf.in, so the test server\n     starts with the updated apache2 (which accepts only qop=auth) and\n     when the build runs as root",
